---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy policy for DevToolkit."
>
  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 prose prose-invert prose-slate">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p><em>Last updated: [add date when you publish]</em></p>

    <h2>What this site collects</h2>
    <p>
      [Describe what you actually collect — e.g. "We use Google Analytics to
      understand site traffic" and/or "We use Google AdSense, which may use
      cookies to serve personalized ads."] Replace this placeholder with your
      real data practices before publishing.
    </p>

    <h2>Cookies and advertising</h2>
    <p>
      This site may use Google AdSense to display ads. Google and its
      partners may use cookies to serve ads based on your visits to this and
      other sites. You can opt out of personalized advertising by visiting
      Google's Ads Settings.
    </p>

    <h2>Third-party tools (Bring Your Own Key)</h2>
    <p>
      Some tools (Commit Message Generator, README Generator, Changelog
      Generator) require you to enter your own Anthropic API key. This key
      is stored only in your browser's local storage and is sent, on each
      request, through a stateless proxy on our server directly to
      Anthropic's API — we do not log, store, or persist your key or your
      request content on our servers.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about this policy? Reach out via the <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
